<Strings>
    <!-- Mod Settings -->
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.NoiseMapIndex">Noise Map</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.NoiseMapIndexDesc">Selects the noise texture used for the volumetric cloud shape (1-5).</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.MinHeight">MinHeight</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.MinHeightDesc">Altitude (m) below which the water transparency override takes effect (when Alter Transparency is enabled).</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.ShowDevLog">Show Dev Log</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.ShowDevLogDesc">Show log messages for developers.</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.AlterTransparency">Alter Transparency</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.AlterTransparencyDesc">Override the game's water transparency setting based on altitude (the original transparency setting has been altered into this one).</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.WaterReflection">Water Reflection</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.WaterReflectionDesc">Render volumetric clouds into the water reflection.</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.ExtraCameraClouds">Extra Camera Clouds</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.ExtraCameraCloudsDesc">Auto-render volumetric clouds on extra world cameras (PIP windows etc.). Detect by behavior only, no mod-specific code.</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.ExtraCameraRain">Extra Camera Rain</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.ExtraCameraRainDesc">Also render rain on extra world cameras (PIP windows etc.). Each camera gets its own rain instance (VRAM and GPU cost scale with the number of cameras); only active while rain is enabled.</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.ShowProfiler">Profiler Overlay</s>
    <s id="Volken.ModSettings.ShowProfilerDesc">Show the in-game performance profiler overlay.</s>

